@startuml

skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

participant "Docker Daemon\n(Host Node)" as Docker
participant "TMF 915\nLifecycle Monitor" as Monitor
database "TMF 915 API\n(AiModel Entity)" as API
actor "Admin / Orchestrator" as User

== Start Deployment Monitoring ==
Monitor -> Docker: Listen to Container Start Event\n(e.g., ai-model-container)
activate Monitor

alt Successful Startup & Network Binding
    == ACTIVE Transition ==
    Docker --> Monitor: Container Running
    Monitor -> Docker: Scan execution ports (e.g., mapped port 8080)
    Docker --> Monitor: Socket Bound Successfully

    Monitor -> Monitor: Extract traits:\nhostPort, dockerHost, imageName, payloadExample
    
    Monitor -> API: Patch AiModel Entity
    note right: Attach traits & change state:\nRESERVED -> ACTIVE
    
    API --> User: Signal Readiness (Deployment Finalized)

else Infrastructure Anomaly / Crash
    == DESIGNED Transition (Graceful Downgrade) ==
    Docker --> Monitor: Process Failure / Timeout\n(e.g., S3 connectivity drop, out-of-memory)
    
    Monitor -> Monitor: Intercept Exception Stacktrace
    
    Monitor -> API: Patch AiModel Entity
    note right: Append stacktrace to Entity Notes array\n& change state: RESERVED -> DESIGNED
    
    API --> User: Alert Admin natively via attached Notes\n(No orchestrator log scraping required)
end

deactivate Monitor

@enduml